{"slug":"a-man-of-his-time","updated":"2026-10-11","item":{"title":"A Man of His Time","slug":"a-man-of-his-time","kind":"movie","language":"French","genre":"History / Comedy","released":"2026-09-30","runtime":155,"review":"September 1940. Henri Marre arrives alone in Vichy as the authoritarian regime settles in. Broke, estranged from his family, and carrying copies of his self-published manifesto Notre Salut (Our Salvation), the 49-year-old is determined to secure what he believes is his rightful place in the new administration. In his writing, Henri sets out his patriotic convictions and his engineer’s methodology: efficiency above all. Claiming he wants to help save France after defeat, he does whatever is required to remain useful, serving the machinery of the new order with increasing skill.","cast":["Swann Arlaud","Mathieu Perotto","Harpo Guit","Yoann Blanc","Thierry de Peretti","Maxim Driesen"],"castPics":[{"name":"Swann Arlaud","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/38iX2NHO7pMdQH1ygoGEJ8E82WV.jpg","character":"Henri Marre"},{"name":"Mathieu Perotto","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gQJXvDulNKsrJduNcIHD5iRw8g.jpg","character":"Gasque"},{"name":"Harpo Guit","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r5BASV0YeeUsfDyMOZOidycsJ7T.jpg","character":"Harpo"},{"name":"Yoann Blanc","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mBed4TQcWd3xhugRUk1yaVNJNP5.jpg","character":"Lemoine"},{"name":"Thierry de Peretti","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w3ERYv9QXHHQRjVU8PEPYWTNJGt.jpg","character":"Dommange"},{"name":"Maxim Driesen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ciVvRgatmRkycvth4L38qwIUvkz.jpg","character":"Jean"}],"providers":[],"rentBuy":[],"platform":"Theatres","rating":6.8,"votes":26,"similar":[{"title":"Too Many Beasts","slug":"too-many-beasts","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myXEa3yLlTrZF28diJ5AnXo9Wvz.jpg,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7PZCUc6xYm4kHlqnKzwgtHRjm8K.jpg","language":"French","kind":"movie"},{"title":"Bon Voyage, Marie","slug